  ("252" 0.8442 0.8729 0.0728 0.0862 0.0862 0.0134 nil 0.0000 0.0287)
  ("During the computation of a critical pair, applying the mgu σ to l_{1} , l_{1} σ can" 0.2282 0.8729 0.1243 0.1390 0.1377 0.0134 0.0070 0.3123 0.0582)
  ("be rewritten to r_{1} σ by l_{1} → r_{1} . At the same time, since l_{1} /pσ = l_{2} σ, l_{1} σ contains an" 0.1812 0.8729 0.1400 0.1596 0.1573 0.0134 0.0054 0.4172 0.0197)
  ("instance of l_{2} at position p, so l_{1} σ can be also rewritten to l_{1} [p ↼ l_{2} ]σ by l_{2} → r_{2} ." 0.1812 0.8729 0.1596 0.1793 0.1769 0.0134 0.0068 0.3694 0.0681)
