  ("The procedure is not an algorithm because it may go on forever due to ever-" 0.2282 0.8730 0.5872 0.6006 0.6006 0.0134 0.0066 0.2433 0.0329)
  ("growing set of rules and critical pairs. Note that the procedure may fail if an" 0.1812 0.8730 0.6068 0.6202 0.6202 0.0134 0.0093 0.2588 0.0654)
  ("equation cannot be oriented into a rewrite rule. There are many attempts to reduce" 0.1812 0.8730 0.6264 0.6398 0.6398 0.0134 0.0054 0.2760 0.0717)
  ("the cases of failures. For instance, if an equation like f (x, g(x)) = h(y, g(y)) cannot" 0.1812 0.8729 0.6460 0.6594 0.6594 0.0134 0.0058 0.2828 0.0266)
