  ("to a common term t′ = t[p_{1} ↼ r_{1} σ_{1} , p_{2} ↼ r_{2} σ_{2} ]." 0.1812 0.5759 0.2571 0.2763 0.2750 0.0134 0.0054 0.5219 0.0170)
  ("Case 2: If p_{1} and p_{2} are not disjoint positions, without loss of generality," 0.2282 0.8730 0.2812 0.2959 0.2947 0.0134 0.0090 0.2345 0.0394)
  ("assume p_{1} = ϵ, then t = l_{1} σ_{1} , and t/p_{2} = l_{1} σ_{1} /p_{2} = l_{2} σ_{2} . There are two subcases to" 0.1812 0.8729 0.3009 0.3156 0.3143 0.0134 0.0062 0.4002 0.0597)
