  ("By induction hypotheses, R is conﬂuent at t_{1} and t_{2} , respectively, because" 0.2282 0.8729 0.4775 0.4922 0.4909 0.0134 0.0084 0.2394 0.0236)
  ("t_{1}  t and t_{2}  t. Now we have shown that t_{1} and t_{2} are rewritten to a common" 0.1812 0.8729 0.4932 0.5129 0.5105 0.0134 0.0072 0.2764 0.0138)
